==================================================
PRODUCT CREATE
==================================================

When the Admin creates a product:

1. Validate the form.
2. Prepare the product object.
3. Generate/create the Firestore document.
4. Save the product to products collection.
5. Set createdAt.
6. Set updatedAt.
7. Refresh/update the UI.

Firebase Storage is NOT available yet.

For now imageUrl may contain an external image URL or temporary URL.

==================================================
PRODUCT UPDATE
==================================================

When Admin edits a product:

1. Load existing product.
2. Populate the form.
3. Allow editing.
4. Validate the form.
5. Update only required fields.
6. Update updatedAt.
7. Refresh/update UI.

Do not duplicate the product document.

==================================================
PRODUCT DELETE
==================================================

When Admin deletes a product:

1. Show a confirmation.
2. Delete the Firestore document.
3. Update the UI.

Do not delete products silently.

If Storage is implemented in the future, image deletion should also be handled then.

